// The difference between built in arrays and matrecies?
//      In their static compile time form they have no differences when it comes
//              to the data being laied out in memory....
//      In the runtime case their will be a difference.
//              In case of an array that will need to be known at run time.
//                      we use either the "[]" slice, or the "[_]" dynamic array.
//                      each of them have a pointer to the data and the size, and (optional) capacity.
//              In case of a matrix we will need
//                      - a pointer to the data.
//                      - a slice of size = number of dimentions.
//                      - a each entry of the slice have a value that contains the size of the dimention.










